# entropy-arb credentials / 密钥配置
#
#   cp .env.example .env-btc then fill in / 复制后填写
#
# Required to trade (the bot is live-only). Only --record-only data
# collection runs without credentials.
# 交易必填（本机器人只有实盘模式）。仅 --record-only 数据采集不需要密钥。
# NEVER commit .env / 切勿提交 .env 到 git。
# Use one file per live market process (for example .env-btc and .env-eth).
# Do not copy the same account into every file: use separate accounts/API keys
# or concurrent orders can collide on nonce/account state and rate limits.
# 每个实盘币种进程使用一个独立文件；不要只是复制同一套密钥，必须使用不同账户/API key。

# ===== light-rh — Lighter Robinhood (always required to trade) =====
# ===== light-rh — Lighter Robinhood 账户（交易必填） =====
# Register an API key on the Robinhood deployment. These fall back to the
# generic LIGHTER_* variables for backward compatibility.
# 在 Robinhood deployment 注册 API key；未填写时兼容回退到 LIGHTER_*。
LIGHTER_RH_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_RH_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# ===== --hedge entropy/tradexyz (optional Hyperliquid credentials) =====
# Entropy/tradexyz shares the Hyperliquid account below by default. To trade it from
# a separate account/agent key, set these:
# 对冲腿为 tradexyz 时默认与上面共用同一 Hyperliquid 账户；
# 如需独立账户/密钥，填写以下两项：
HL_PRIVATE_KEY=
HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=
# Aster Futures API credentials (required only with --hedge aster)
# Create an Aster Futures API key/secret and restrict its permissions/IP.
ASTER_API_KEY=
ASTER_API_SECRET=
#HL_PRIVATE_KEY_XYZ=
#HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS_XYZ=

# ===== --hedge lighter =====
# ===== 对冲腿为 Lighter 主网时填写（light-rh 已固定为主腿） =====
# Register an API key for the SAME deployment as your --hedge flag
# (mainnet and the Robinhood chain are separate accounts and separate keys).
# See https://github.com/elliottech/lighter-python for key setup.
# 注意：Lighter 主网与 Robinhood 链是两套独立账户和密钥，必须与启动时的
# --hedge 参数一致。密钥生成方法见 lighter-python 官方仓库。
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_PRIVATE_KEY=
